WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.220
- So how are things at "The Voice"?

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.900
I know you miss me.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.733
- Oh my God.

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:06.213
So Bad.
- [Kelly] Yeah, I know.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.880
- You know, it's,

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.040
Camila has done a good job.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.450
Nobody's you, Okay?

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.383
Let's just say, there's
only one Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:15.216
(audience cheers)

00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:17.557
- Good start! (laughs)

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:18.390
- But,

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.330
there is one person we've found

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.160
who can talk as much as you,

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.390
and that's Camila.
(audience laughing)

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.223
- She's been on here.

00:00:25.223 --> 00:00:26.280
I know I've met her.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.560
Yeah. We had to edit down our interview.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.810
There's no way you guys
could be on the same season

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.010
with each other, ever.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.330
- It'd have to be a
different kind of show.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:34.163
She's passionate.

00:00:34.163 --> 00:00:35.010
She likes talking.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:35.843
She's really into it.

00:00:35.843 --> 00:00:37.170
I love her though, for the show.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.250
I think it's really cool.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.930
- Although, unlike you, she's,

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.300
when she talks she makes sense.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.230
(audience laughing)

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.280
When you do your spiel,

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.120
you know how you do--

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.080
- No.
- Like you don't even know

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:46.920
you've lost track
- No, no.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.830
by the time you end your paragraph,

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.840
your book,
- I am very prolific.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.472
- You don't even know what
you started out saying.

00:00:52.472 --> 00:00:53.380
(audience laughing)

